# Read This Please

This is a personal webpage. It has historical content which I maintain in my own personal fight against linkrot. It identifies students I have worked with. If someone says I have mentored them successfully and they are on on this page I either did not successfully mentor them or I have forgotten to add them. Please feel welcome to inquire. 

This page reflects only my own opinions. Some of these opinions change over time. For example, like many others,  thought Snowden was motivated by the kind of my country right its wrongs patriotism. Then he went to China. Then he moved to Russia. I was wrong. When I err I change my mind but not my record. 
